    "### Soal A5 – Gradient Descent & Learning Rate\n",
    "1. Latih model `LinearRegressionGD` (dari materi) dengan `n_iterations=5000` menggunakan **3 nilai learning rate**: `0.001`, `0.02`, dan `0.1`.\n",
